OL,3,AConsultant doctors in England to strike
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after talks had
OL,7,Ftaken place with the government over
OL,8,Fthe past month following the vote in
OL,9,Ffavour of strike action by British
OL,10,FMedical Association members in July.
